@baseUrl = http://localhost:5237
@token = your-jwt-token-here
@characterId = 1
@scifiCharacterId = 1

### Get all scifi characters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get scifi character by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/{{scifiCharacterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get scifi character by character id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/by-character/{{characterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create a scifi character (minimal - no race/class/background)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "characterId": {{characterId}}
}

###

### Create a scifi character (with optional fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "characterId": {{characterId}},
    "scifiRaceId": 1,
    "scifiSubraceId": 1,
    "scifiClassId": 1,
    "scifiBackgroundId": 1
}

###

### Create a scifi character (with free stat picks; stat = StatType enum, 0 Str, 1 Con, 2 Dex, 3 Wis, 4 Cha, 5 Int)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "characterId": {{characterId}},
    "scifiRaceId": 1,
    "scifiClassId": 1,
    "scifiBackgroundId": 1,
    "statPicks": [
        { "stat": 3, "amount": 1 },
        { "stat": 4, "amount": 1 }
    ]
}

###

### Create a scifi character (with background talent pick; must be in the pickable pool for the class + background, see scifiTalent.http)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "characterId": {{characterId}},
    "scifiRaceId": 1,
    "scifiClassId": 1,
    "scifiBackgroundId": 1,
    "backgroundTalentId": 1
}

###

### Update scifi character - set race and class, leave background alone
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/{{scifiCharacterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "scifiRaceId": 1,
    "scifiClassId": 1
}

###

### Update scifi character - set subrace and free stat picks
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/{{scifiCharacterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "scifiSubraceId": 1,
    "statPicks": [
        { "stat": 3, "amount": 1 }
    ]
}

###

### Update scifi character - pick/change background talent (requires class and background to be set)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/{{scifiCharacterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "backgroundTalentId": 1
}

###

### Update scifi character - change class and background (talents re-sync) and pick background talent
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/{{scifiCharacterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "scifiClassId": 2,
    "scifiBackgroundId": 2,
    "backgroundTalentId": 1
}

###

### Update scifi character - clear race (and subrace) only
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/{{scifiCharacterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "scifiRaceId": 0
}

###

### Update scifi character - clear everything
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/{{scifiCharacterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "scifiRaceId": 0,
    "scifiClassId": 0,
    "scifiBackgroundId": 0
}

###

### Delete scifi character
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scificharacter/{{scifiCharacterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}